window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Jessie returns from her mission in Africa humiliated, dejected and frustrated with her faith and commitment to her order. </p> <p>While back at home, she reconnects with her estranged mother and also rendezvous with an old friend from high school who has a reputation for being a party girl. Together they are about to have one wild night of forbidden pleasure, a night that could threaten Jessie's continued commitment of being a nun. </p> <p><b>Warning:</b> This erotic story is for adults only. Please be 18 years of age or older. </p>"; 
